    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "source": "When your app enters a state where using a video decoder resources is not permissible, the value of this property changes to [`true`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/true) along with the video renderer’s status changing to [`AVQueuedSampleBufferRenderingStatus.failed`](avqueuedsamplebufferrenderingstatus/failed.md).",
      "ko": "앱이 비디오 디코더 리소스를 사용할 수 없는 상태가 되면 비디오 렌더러의 상태가 [`AVQueuedSampleBufferRenderingStatus.failed`](avqueuedsamplebufferrenderingstatus/failed.md)로 변경되는 동시에 이 속성의 값이 [`true`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/true)로 바뀝니다.",
      "sourceHash": "3b6e8b687d3402e3c069983629dfc1df522a4affc678d0bc7fc2653338fb6438",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0002",
      "source": "To resume rendering sample buffers, you must first reset the video renderer by calling [`flush()`](avqueuedsamplebufferrendering/flush().md) or [`flush(removingDisplayedImage:completionHandler:)`](avsamplebuffervideorenderer/flush(removingdisplayedimage:completionhandler:).md).",
      "ko": "샘플 버퍼 렌더링을 재개하려면 먼저 [`flush()`](avqueuedsamplebufferrendering/flush().md) 또는 [`flush(removingDisplayedImage:completionHandler:)`](avsamplebuffervideorenderer/flush(removingdisplayedimage:completionhandler:).md)를 호출해 비디오 렌더러를 리셋해야 합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "98f29f99e4b1a3fb1231731196fa02d88a3cc2400c0732c89c0af495021b6c71",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0009:0001",
      "source": "This property is not key-value observable.",
      "ko": "이 속성은 키-값 관찰이 지원되지 않습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "15e12fc646503b7b6c44256bcce2e422879bb458d9c75ba46296b4896f921aea",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0009:0002",
      "source": "Instead, track changes to this property by observing notifications of type [`requiresFlushToResumeDecodingDidChangeNotification`](avsamplebuffervideorenderer/requiresflushtoresumedecodingdidchangenotification.md).",
      "ko": "대신 이 속성의 변경은 [`requiresFlushToResumeDecodingDidChangeNotification`](avsamplebuffervideorenderer/requiresflushtoresumedecodingdidchangenotification.md) 유형의 알림을 관찰하여 추적합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "616b2446deec3b207b5ac4f804673370771a2a3b14d6c9214fd2eae54c226724",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
